BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free “Syd Mead” Exhibition Opening: Sci-Fi Blade Runner Futuri
 st (Transamerica Bldg.)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T200000
DTSTAMP:20261007T060815Z
UID:funcheap-1641266@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Movies
DESCRIPTION:Bright Future Arts\, Syd Mead TrustFollowing its critically ac
 claimed 2025 debut in New York\, Syd Mead: Future Pastime comes to the Wes
 t Coast at the Transamerica Pyramid Annex Gallery\, opening Thursday\, Oct
 ober 8th\, from 6pm to 8pm.\nFew artists have shaped how the world picture
 s tomorrow as thoroughly as Syd Mead. For more than half a century\, the s
 elf-described “visual futurist” set the vocabulary that designers\, en
 gineers\, architects and filmmakers still draw on. He showed that the futu
 re could be drafted with precision rather than guessed at. That work began
  in industry\, where Ford and U.S. Steel hired him to imagine what came ne
 xt\, and it reached millions through the films he helped design\, among th
 em Blade Runner\, TRON and Aliens.\nHis gouache paintings show tomorrow wi
 th enough engineering logic to work as blueprints. But his real subject wa
 s never the machines. It was the people living with them: a casual drive t
 hrough cerulean space\, mechanical hounds racing above the skyscrapers\, a
  dinner party in steel couture. Mead’s future is neither dystopian nor a
 bstract. It is lived-in\, leisurely and deeply human.\n\nThirty years afte
 r his last major Bay Area exhibition – just as the tools he forecast are
  finally arriving – Future Pastime asks San Francisco to reconsider the 
 future it is building\, and who it is for.\nSyd Mead: Future Pastime runs 
 10/9 – 12/17\, Weds-Sun\, 11am-6pm.\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://futurepa
 stime.net\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/free-syd-mead-exhibition-openi
 ng-scifi-blade-runner-futurist-transamerica-bldg/\nSource: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/DIGITA
 L_INVITE_05.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T060815Z
LOCATION:Transamerica Pyramid Annex Gallery\, 535 Washington St\, San Fran
 cisco 94111
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/free-syd-mead-exhibition-opening-scifi-blade-r
 unner-futurist-transamerica-bldg/
END:VEVENT
