 psis: Simon\, a seasoned director\, begins filming a movie about a group o
 f workers fighting to save their factory. But between his producer’s sha
 dy dealings\, egocentric actors\, and a crew on edge\, he quickly finds hi
 mself overwhelmed. Abandoned by his financiers\, Simon must face a labor d
 ispute with his own team. Amidst this hellish shoot\, his only ally is the
  young extra he entrusted with directing the making-of.\n\nDirector: Cédr
 ic Kahn\nMain cast: Denis Podalydès\, Jonathan Cohen\, Stefan Crepon\, So
