SUMMARY:Ginger Snaps
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T213000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001200Z
UID:dothebay-17830866@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:One of the dumbest prejudices perpetuated by the world is that
  menstrual cycles turn women into monsters. That conceit is what makes GIN
 GER SNAPS so incredible. The Fitzgerald sisters are death-obsessed high sc
 hool goths who create ultra-violent art projects while battling the popula
 r kids. But everything changes when someone’s period – and a werewolf 
 – enters the picture. Combining the revisionist energy of AN AMERICAN WE
 REWOLF IN LONDON\, the body-horror of SHIVERS\, and the black humor of HAR
 OLD AND MAUDE\, GINGER SNAPS is unpredictable and unbelievably fun. It’s
  also a takedown of gender bias in the form of a werewolf movie.\n\nTicket
 s: https://drafthouse.com/sf/show/terror-tuesday-ginger-snaps?cinemaId=080
 2&sessionId=21341\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/13/ginger-
 snaps-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
