DESCRIPTION:Presented in Japanese with English subtitles\n\nBig dreams\, a
  shared passion – on the ice\, they call it love. After suffering a humi
 liating loss at the Grand Prix Final\, Japan’s number one skater\, Yuri 
 Katsuki\, is ready to hang up his skates for good. But when his idol and f
 ive-time champion Victor Nikiforov offers to be his coach\, Yuri’s put o
 n a trek for gold and to discover the true meaning of victory! Together\, 
 they’ll face skaters from around the world.\n\nTickets: https://drafthou
 se.com/sf/show/crunchyroll-anime-nights-yuri-on-ice-subtitled-10th-anniver
