SUMMARY:One In A Million
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T154000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261024T174000
DTSTAMP:20261006T003107Z
UID:dothebay-17883955@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Post-screening Q&A with director Jack MacInnes & film subject\
 , Israa!\n\nFilmed over ten years\, ONE IN A MILLION follows Israa from ch
 ildhood to adulthood on an extraordinary journey from Syria to Germany —
  and back again. We first meet her at age 11 as she and her family are pre
 paring to cross the Aegean Sea\, risking everything in search of safety an
 d a better life in Europe. What unfolds is a deeply personal chronicle of 
 war\, exile and heartbreak\, as Israa grows up navigating adolescence\, id
 entity and belonging far from the home she was forced to leave. As Israa s
 ettles into life in Germany\, new freedoms collide with the stabilizing pu
 ll of Syrian traditions\, testing bonds and reshaping her sense of self.\n
 \nCo-directed by Itab Azzam and Jack MacInnes\, the film bears witness to 
 the remarkable trust between filmmakers and family\, following Israa and h
 er loved ones across borders\, cultures and shifting circumstances. An int
 imate and nuanced coming-of-age story\, ONE IN A MILLION illuminates the c
 omplexities of the refugee experience while asking a universal question: w
 hat does it truly mean to call a place home?\n\nRuntime\n\n1h 45m\n\nYear\
 n\n2026\n\nDirector\n\nItab Azzam and Jack MacInnes\n\nFormat\n\nDCP\n\nCo
 untry\n\nUK\n\nLanguage\n\nArabic\, German\, English with English subtitle
 s\n\nFirst Showing\n\nOctober 24\, 2026\n\nCategories\n\nFeatured\n\nTicke
 ts: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.com/purchase/22170?siteToken=4m48btf3ya
 vn7xjk5yxk6nc40c\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/24/one-in-a
 -million-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
GEO:37.7647103;-122.4224081
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/34619937/f158636e-32d7-4a33-ae51-e01a1d9e20b4.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T003107Z
LOCATION:Roxie Theater\, 3117 16th Street\, San Francisco\, CA\, 94103
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/24/one-in-a-million-tickets
END:VEVENT
