DESCRIPTION:In order to get away from their busy lives\, the Wilson family
  takes a vacation to Santa Cruz\, California. At night\, four strangers br
 eak into Adelaide’s childhood home. The family is shocked to find out th
 at the intruders look like them.\n\nAbout Floating Features\n\nSan Francis
 co Legacy Businesses Red and White Fleet and The Roxie are partnering to t
 urn the hybrid electric vessel Enhydra into a sailing cinema for a limited
