CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:The lead protagonist of a film disappears mid production\, and
  his family and crew search for him before tragic news reaches them. Wajda
 ’s first film where he received sole screenwriting credit\, this deeply 
 personal homage to his beloved actor Zbigniew Cybulski\, the star of Ashes
  and Diamonds\, is also a scathing portrait of the film industry.\n\nThe f
 ilm-within-a-film mirrors the real life tragedy\, with actors channeling t
 heir real life experiences into their performances. Weaving together autob
 iography and fiction\, Wajda questions what it means to be an artist and h
 ow we mourn by creating legends as a way to interpret the past. A deeply p
 ersonal homage that mirrors the tragic death of iconic actor Zbigniew Cybu
 lski\, the “Polish James Dean.”\n\nScreenings of Andrzej Wajda’s fil
 ms in the USA in 2026 are part of the ‘Wajda 100 Tour – North America
 ’ project\, organized by DI Factory with the financial support of the Po
 lish Film Institute.\n\nRuntime\n\n1h 45m\n\nYear\n\n1969\n\nDirector\n\nA
 ndrzej Wajda\n\nFormat\n\nDCP\n\nCountry\n\nPoland\n\nLanguage\n\nPolish w
 ith English subtitles\n\nFirst Showing\n\nNovember 8\, 2026\n\nCategories\
 n\nWajda at 100\n\n\,\n\nFeatured\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.vee
 zi.com/purchase/22249?siteToken=4m48btf3yavn7xjk5yxk6nc40c\nDetails: https
 ://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/8/everything-for-sale-tickets\nSource: DoTh
 eBay
