DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment Presents\nClaudio Simonetti’s G
 oblin\nPerforms the Live Score to Tenebre\nTuesday\, November 10 | The Cas
 tro\n\nComposer Claudio Simonetti has written and recorded some of the mos
 t influential scores and soundtracks in horror\, including Suspiria\, Dawn
  of the Dead\, Deep Red / Profondo Rosso\, Demons\, and many others\, with
  his seminal work still informing the genre to this day. This year\, Simon
 etti’s Goblin celebrates Dario Argento’s 1982 critically acclaimed cla
 ssic\, Tenebre\, with a live performance of the score set to a screening o
 f the film. Following the finale of the movie\, the collective will return
  after a brief intermission to deliver an additional performance of quinte
 ssential Goblin material and “best of” songs and scores set to their c
 inematic counterparts.\n\nRated R\nAnother Planet Entertainment Presents\n
 Listed time is doors\n\nTickets: https://thecastro.com/events/claudio-simo
