DESCRIPTION:Presented in Japanese with English subtitles\n\nThe world-famo
 us classic Alice in Wonderland receives its first Japanese theatrical anim
 ated adaptation!\n\nRise Azumino is a university student who feels lost in
  her life. One day\, guided by an invitation letter left behind by her lat
 e grandmother\, she enters “Wonderland”. She meets a girl named Alice 
 there and they travel together. The Queen of Hearts\, the Mad Hatter\, Che
 shire Cat…the residents of Wonderland appear before Rise one after anoth
 er and crazy commotion ensues! What kind of future will Rise choose in thi
 s crazy adventure with Alice?\n\nTickets: https://drafthouse.com/sf/show/d
 ive-in-wonderland?cinemaId=0802&sessionId=22086\nDetails: https://dothebay
