DESCRIPTION:Professor Seagull's SmartshopCatch a free screening of Mondo N
 ew York in North Beach.\nThis cult film offers a dreamlike look at New Yor
 k’s late-’80s underground scene\, moving through clubs\, strange encou
 nters\, performance art\, and an unforgettable cast of downtown characters
 . Atmospheric\, messy\, stylish\, and deeply of its moment\, it’s a vivi
 d snapshot of a vanished creative world.\nPart of the Psychedelic Film Ser
 ies at Live Worms / Church of Mother Gong.\n\nWednesday\, November 18 at 7
  PM1345 Grant Ave.\, San FranciscoFree\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eve
 ntbrite.com/e/1989057550678?aff=oddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://sf.funchea
