SUMMARY:3rd Annual “A Very Purple NYE” w/ Purple Rain And Sign “O”
  The Times (Vogue Theatre)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261231T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20270101T020000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1637646@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Movies
DESCRIPTION:Warner Brothers / SWANKThe VOGUE Theatre Presents ~\nA Very Pu
 rple New Years Eve!\n3rd Annual NYE Party!\n\nFeaturing A 4K Restoration O
 f\nPURPLE RAIN\nAnd\nConcert Film ~ Sign ☮️ The Times\nThursday Decemb
 er 31 New Years Eve!\nDoors Open At 9:00pm\nPurple Music Videos\, Before T
 he Film!\nPurple Rain Starting At 10:00pm\n\nMidnight Countdown With Compl
 imentary Champagne Toast* And Party Favors!\nThen Right Into Sign ☮️ T
 he Times\,\nKeeping The Party Going!\nTickets Are Just $25- And All Ages W
 elcome!\nPurple Rain ~\n“The Kid” (Prince) is a troubled Minneapolis m
 usician. He and his band\, The Revolution are one of three acts playing at
  a local nightclub\, the First Avenue. The other acts are The Time\, a fun
 k band\, lead by Morris Day and The Modernaires\, a new wave band\, lead b
 y Dez Dickerson.\nAspiring singer Apollonia\, comes to town to try her luc
